            "review_title": "Review at Hoa Vien Brauhaus",
            "review_text": "Raintree_Thailand\nBangkok, Thailand4675 contributions\n0\nClassic Vietnamese brew pub!\nJan 2025 • Couples\nHoa Vien is one of the oldest brew pubs in Vietnam (they also have a branch in Hanoi). They brew good-quality Czech-style beer and serve the usual menu of bar food. It's a real working brewery, complete with copper brewing kettles. It's a fun place. Prices are very reasonable (87K VND for a half liter).\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 18, 2025",
