            "review_text": "Harry H\n138 contributions\n0\nExpensive and poor quality\nMar 2024 • Friends\nThey only brew 2 types of beer, so not much choice. And the quality of the beer is so so. We ordered food and were recommended the dry aged beef. The meat looked excellent, we ordered 600 g, but unfortunately was poorly prepared. In stead of a nice tender piece of rib eye it was dry and chewy, costing approx 100 Euro. Adding to that the fries which were way too crispy, the baked potato half burned what should have been a festive meal became a big disappointment.\nRead more\nWritten March 12, 2024",
