            "review_text": "LPN\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam82 contributions\n0\nAccidental awesome\nFeb 2020 • Friends\nI came here completely unexpectedly. I was dragooned into coming here by a friend and somehow ended up at a big table with a mix of Slovak and Czech tourists or expats. They and the staff made me feel welcome. The beer here is cheap (40k for small house beer) and is fantastic. The service was also excellent. I will be back to try some of the food! If you can’t read Czech or Vietnamese there are plenty of food pictures to point at haha.\nRead more\nWritten February 10, 2020",
