            "review_title": "Review at Hoa Vien Brauhaus",
            "review_text": "Tim G\nTay Ninh, Vietnam80 contributions\n0\nMust have missed something?\nDec 2018 • Solo\nI was surprised after reading the reviews. They were quite good. I must have missed something as I wasn’t the least bit impressed. I must admit though, I didn’t eat anything but rather stopped in for a drink and to cool off. At the time, there weren’t many customers except for a few at the bar. Although there were a few staff members behind the bar, it took forever to be acknowledged and waited on. They were too busy talking to each other. They didn’t speak English or at least had no desire to communicate. The atmosphere was dismal at best. Other than the copper beer kettles, there wasn’t much else to look at. Maybe if you really like German food and warm beer, this could be the place for you.\nRead more\nWritten March 31, 2019",
